t</a><a class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__navLink \" href=\"/courses\">Courses</a><a class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__navLink \" href=\"/gallery\">Gallery</a><a class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__navLink \" href=\"/brouchers\">Brouchers</a><a class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__navLink \" href=\"/certificate\">Certificate</a><a class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__navLink \" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a><a class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__navLink \" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a></nav><div class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__authButtons\"><a class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__signupBtn\" href=\"/contact\">SignUp</a><a class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__loginBtn\" href=\"/contact\">LogIn</a></div><button class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__menuButton\" aria-label=\"Open Menu\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" height=\"26\" width=\"26\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div><div class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__mobileMenu \"><button class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__closeButton\" aria-label=\"Close Menu\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" height=\"26\" width=\"26\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button><nav class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__mobileNav\"><a class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__mobileNavLink \" href=\"/\">Home</a><a class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__mobileNavLink \" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__mobileNavLink \" href=\"/courses\">Courses</a><a class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__mobileNavLink \" href=\"/gallery\">Gallery</a><a class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__mobileNavLink \" href=\"/brouchers\">Brouchers</a><a class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__mobileNavLink \" href=\"/certificate\">Certificate</a><a class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__mobileNavLink \" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a><a class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__mobileNavLink \" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a></nav><div class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__mobileAuth\"><a class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__signupBtn\" href=\"/contact\">SignUp</a><a class=\"Header-module-scss-module__q-6czq__loginBtn\" href=\"/contact\">LogIn</a></div></div></header><div><section class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__courseHeroSection\" data-aos=\"zoom-in\"><div class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__container\"><nav class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__separator\">/</span><a href=\"/courses\">Courses</a><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__separator\">/</span><span>Information Technology &amp; Networking</span></nav><div class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__heroContent\"><div class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__leftContent\"><h1 class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__title\">Information Technology &amp; Networking</h1><p class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__description\">Master SEO, social media, Google Ads, and analytics to plan, execute, and measure campaigns that drive real results. From concept to conversion — learn every step hands-on with guidance from industry mentors.</p><a href=\"/contact\"><button class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__connectButton\">Contact Us</button></a></div><div class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__rightCard\"><div class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__decorativePattern\"><div class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dotPattern\"><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__dot\"></span></div></div><div class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__infoCard\"><div class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__priceSection\"><h2 class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__price\">$200</h2><h3 class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__cardTitle\">Course Information</h3></div><div class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__courseDetails\"><div class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__detailRow\"><div class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__detailLabel\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M2 4L10 2L18 4V11C18 15 10 18 10 18C10 18 2 15 2 11V4Z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span>Level</span></div><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__detailValue\">Beginner</span></div><div class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__detailRow\"><div class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__detailLabel\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 8H17\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><path d=\"M7 1V4M13 1V4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg><span>Lectures</span></div><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__detailValue\">32 Lectures</span></div><div class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__detailRow\"><div class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__detailLabel\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M10 6V10L13 13\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg><span>Duration</span></div><span class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__detailValue\">6 Months</span></div></div><a href=\"/brouchers\"><button class=\"CourseHero-module-scss-module__etmHLq__startButton\">Download Brochure<svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 10H16M16 10L11 5M16 10L11 15\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__courseAboutSection\" data-aos=\"zoom-in\"><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__container\"><h2 class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__mainTitle\">About this course</h2><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__description\"><p class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__paragraph\">This program helps you go beyond buzzwords. Learn digital marketing strategies, performance tools, and creative techniques that actually work in the real market.</p><p class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__paragraph\">You&#x27;ll train through live campaigns, analytics dashboards, and ad simulations, gaining the confidence to plan and optimize marketing initiatives from day one.</p><p class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__paragraph\">Skill Haara delivers ISO 9001:2015 and 21001:2018–certified training with modern labs, expert mentors, and structured placement guidance across all Kerala branches.</p><p class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__paragraph\">Available in Trivandrum, Kochi (Aluva), and Thrissur</p></div><h3 class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__sectionTitle\">What you&#x27;ll learn</h3><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__learningGrid\"><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__learningItem\"><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__checkmark\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17L4 12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__itemContent\"><h4 class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__itemTitle\">Search Engine Optimization (SEO)</h4><p class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__itemDescription\">Learn how Google ranks pages, master on-page, off-page, and technical SEO to improve visibility.</p></div></div><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__learningItem\"><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__checkmark\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17L4 12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__itemContent\"><h4 class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__itemTitle\">Social Media Marketing</h4><p class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__itemDescription\">Create and manage campaigns for Facebook, Instagram, and LinkedIn that attract real engagement.</p></div></div><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__learningItem\"><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__checkmark\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17L4 12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__itemContent\"><h4 class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__itemTitle\">Google Ads &amp; PPC</h4><p class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__itemDescription\">Understand campaign setup, bidding strategies, and ad copywriting to deliver measurable ROI.</p></div></div><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__learningItem\"><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__checkmark\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17L4 12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__itemContent\"><h4 class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__itemTitle\">Email &amp; Content Marketing</h4><p class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__itemDescription\">Build audiences through storytelling, automation, and data-driven content planning.</p></div></div><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__learningItem\"><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__checkmark\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17L4 12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__itemContent\"><h4 class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__itemTitle\">Web Analytics (Google Analytics &amp; Tag Manager)</h4><p class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__itemDescription\">Track, measure, and interpret performance with confidence.</p></div></div><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__learningItem\"><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__checkmark\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17L4 12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__itemContent\"><h4 class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__itemTitle\">Brand Strategy &amp; Digital Planning</h4><p class=\"CourseAbout-module-scss-module__JLZKlq__itemDescription\">Connect creativity with data to build meaningful online presence.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"LearningWorks-module-scss-module__d9eMCq__learningWorksSection\" data-aos=\"zoom-in\"><div class=\"LearningWorks-module-scss-module__d9eMCq__container\"><div class=\"LearningWorks-module-scss-module__d9eMCq__content\"><div class=\"LearningWorks-module-scss-module__d9eMCq__leftColumn\"><div class=\"LearningWorks-module-scss-module__d9eMCq__card\"><h2 class=\"LearningWorks-module-scss-module__d9eMCq__cardTitle\">How learning works here</h2><ul class=\"LearningWorks-module-scss-module__d9eMCq__bulletList\"><li class=\"LearningWorks-module-scss-module__d9eMCq__bulletItem\">Every concept moves from demo → guided lab → live project.</li><li class=\"LearningWorks-module-scss-module__d9eMCq__bulletItem\">Mentors ensure clarity and progress through regular feedback, while small batches keep learning interactive.</li><li class=\"LearningWorks-module-scss-module__d9eMCq__bulletItem\">By the end, you&#x27;ll complete real campaigns and add measurable results to your portfolio.</li></ul></div><div class=\"LearningWorks-module-scss-module__d9eMCq__card\"><h2 class=\"LearningWorks-module-scss-module__d9eMCq__cardTitle\">Who this fits</h2><ul class=\"LearningWorks-module-scss-module__d9eMCq__bulletList\"><li class=\"LearningWorks-module-scss-module__d9eMCq__bulletItem\">Students after 12th or graduates who want a career in marketing, media, or content.</li><li class=\"LearningWorks-module-scss-module__d9eMCq__bulletItem\">Entrepreneurs and freelancers seeking to grow their own brands or client base.</li><li class=\"LearningWorks-module-scss-module__d9eMCq__bulletItem\">Working professionals ready to switch into digital-first roles without losing momentum.</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"LearningWorks-module-scss-module__d9eMCq__rightColumn\"><div class=\"LearningWorks-module-scss-module__d9eMCq__imageWrapper\"><img alt=\"Students learning digital marketing and IT networking\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"LearningWorks-module-scss-module__d9eMCq__image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 968px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fdigitalmarketing.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fdigitalmarketing.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fdigitalmarketing.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fdigitalmarketing.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fdigitalmarketing.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fdigitalmarketing.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fdigitalmarketing.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fdigitalmarketing.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fdigitalmarketing.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimages%2Fdigitalmarketing.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__outcomesSection\" data-aos=\"zoom-in\"><div class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__container\"><div class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__outcomesBlock\"><h2 class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__mainTitle\">Outcomes that matter</h2><p class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__description\">Confidently manage SEO, SEM, and social media campaigns. Build digital portfolios that showcase campaigns you&#x27;ve planned and executed. Graduate job-ready for roles like Digital Marketing Executive, SEO Analyst, Social Media Manager, or PPC Specialist.</p></div><div><h2 class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__mainTitle\">Certifications we prepare for</h2><div class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__certificatesList\"><div class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__certificateItem\"><div class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__checkIcon\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"11\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M8 12L11 15L16 9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__certificateContent\"><span class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__certificateTitle\">Google Ads Certification</span></div></div><div class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__certificateItem\"><div class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__checkIcon\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"11\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M8 12L11 15L16 9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__certificateContent\"><span class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__certificateTitle\">HubSpot Content Marketing</span></div></div><div class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__certificateItem\"><div class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__checkIcon\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"11\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M8 12L11 15L16 9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__certificateContent\"><span class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__certificateTitle\">Meta (Facebook) Blueprint</span></div></div><div class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__certificateItem\"><div class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__checkIcon\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"11\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M8 12L11 15L16 9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__certificateContent\"><span class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__certificateTitle\">Skill Haara Program Certificate</span><span class=\"OutcomesCertificates-module-scss-module__Rto6OG__certificateDescription\"> — <!-- -->Our mentors also guide you through freelancing setup and interview preparation so your skills translate into real projects and job opportunities.</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__availabilitySection\" data-aos=\"zoom-in\"><div class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__container\"><div class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__card\"><h2 class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__title\">Kerala availability</h2><div class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__divider\"></div><div class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__locationsGrid\"><div class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__locationItem\"><div class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__locationHeader\"><div class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__checkIcon\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><path d=\"M8 12L11 15L16 9\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__locationName\">Trivandrum</h3></div><p class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__locationDescription\">Hands-on campaign labs, SEO &amp; Analytics practice, placement prep.</p></div><div class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__locationItem\"><div class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__locationHeader\"><div class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__checkIcon\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><path d=\"M8 12L11 15L16 9\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__locationName\">Kochi (Aluva)</h3></div><p class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__locationDescription\">Social media &amp; Google Ads focus with mentor-led practicals.</p></div><div class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__locationItem\"><div class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__locationHeader\"><div class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__checkIcon\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><path d=\"M8 12L11 15L16 9\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__locationName\">Thrissur</h3></div><p class=\"KeralaAvailability-module-scss-module__mOeCyG__locationDescription\">Full-stack digital marketing coverage with project guidance and job counseling.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__latestCoursesSection\" data-aos=\"zoom-in\"><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__container\"><h2 class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__title\">Related Courses</h2><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__coursesGrid\"><a href=\"/courses/digital-marketing\"><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseCard\"><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__imageWrapper\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/3184465/pexels-photo-3184465.jpeg\" alt=\"Digital Marketing\" class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseImage\"/></div><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__cardContent\"><h3 class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseTitle\">Digital Marketing</h3><p class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseDescription\">Learn how to promote any brand online with SEO, Google Ads, social media, and content marketing. Work on live campaigns that teach you how to attract, engage, and convert real customers — perfect for freelancers and marketing beginners.</p><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__cardFooter\"><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__levelInfo\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__levelIcon\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"12\" width=\"3\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#4b5563\"></rect><rect x=\"8.5\" y=\"8\" width=\"3\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#4b5563\"></rect><rect x=\"15\" y=\"4\" width=\"3\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#4b5563\"></rect></svg><span class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__levelText\">All Levels</span></div><button class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__learnMoreButton\">Learn more</button></div></div></div></a><a href=\"/courses/fashion-designing\"><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseCard\"><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__imageWrapper\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6311575/pexels-photo-6311575.jpeg\" alt=\"Fashion Designing\" class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseImage\"/></div><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__cardContent\"><h3 class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseTitle\">Fashion Designing</h3><p class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseDescription\">Turn your creativity into a career. Learn illustration, garment construction, Aari embroidery, CAD pattern making, and boutique management through guided studio sessions that bring your designs to life.</p><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__cardFooter\"><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__levelInfo\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__levelIcon\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"12\" width=\"3\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#4b5563\"></rect><rect x=\"8.5\" y=\"8\" width=\"3\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#4b5563\"></rect><rect x=\"15\" y=\"4\" width=\"3\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#4b5563\"></rect></svg><span class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__levelText\">All Levels</span></div><button class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__learnMoreButton\">Learn more</button></div></div></div></a><a href=\"/courses/interior-designing-&amp;-architecture\"><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseCard\"><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__imageWrapper\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/1571460/pexels-photo-1571460.jpeg\" alt=\"Interior Designing &amp; Architecture\" class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseImage\"/></div><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__cardContent\"><h3 class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseTitle\">Interior Designing &amp; Architecture</h3><p class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseDescription\">Discover how to plan, draft, and visualise spaces with AutoCAD, 3ds Max, Revit, and lighting techniques. Work on live interior projects that build confidence to design real homes and commercial spaces.</p><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__cardFooter\"><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__levelInfo\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__levelIcon\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"12\" width=\"3\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#4b5563\"></rect><rect x=\"8.5\" y=\"8\" width=\"3\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#4b5563\"></rect><rect x=\"15\" y=\"4\" width=\"3\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#4b5563\"></rect></svg><span class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__levelText\">All Levels</span></div><button class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__learnMoreButton\">Learn more</button></div></div></div></a><a href=\"/courses/graphic-designing-&amp;-animation\"><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseCard\"><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__imageWrapper\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/4348403/pexels-photo-4348403.jpeg\" alt=\"Graphic Designing &amp; Animation\" class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseImage\"/></div><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__cardContent\"><h3 class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseTitle\">Graphic Designing &amp; Animation</h3><p class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseDescription\">Master Photoshop, Illustrator, CorelDRAW, and motion tools like After Effects and Blender. Learn to design visuals, edit videos, and animate stories — everything you need to start a creative design or animation career.</p><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__cardFooter\"><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__levelInfo\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__levelIcon\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"12\" width=\"3\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#4b5563\"></rect><rect x=\"8.5\" y=\"8\" width=\"3\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#4b5563\"></rect><rect x=\"15\" y=\"4\" width=\"3\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#4b5563\"></rect></svg><span class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__levelText\">All Levels</span></div><button class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__learnMoreButton\">Learn more</button></div></div></div></a><a href=\"/courses/software-development-&amp;-management\"><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseCard\"><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__imageWrapper\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/3861969/pexels-photo-3861969.jpeg\" alt=\"Software Development &amp; Management\" class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseImage\"/></div><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__cardContent\"><h3 class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseTitle\">Software Development &amp; Management</h3><p class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__courseDescription\">Build full-stack applications from scratch — HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Python, databases, and DevOps. Gain project management and agile skills to deliver software that’s efficient, scalable, and ready for real clients.</p><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__cardFooter\"><div class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__levelInfo\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__levelIcon\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"12\" width=\"3\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#4b5563\"></rect><rect x=\"8.5\" y=\"8\" width=\"3\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#4b5563\"></rect><rect x=\"15\" y=\"4\" width=\"3\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#4b5563\"></rect></svg><span class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__levelText\">All Levels</span></div><button class=\"LatestCoursesTwo-module-scss-module__6feOya__learnMoreButton\">Learn more</button></div></div></div></a></div></div></section><section class=\"Testimonials-module-scss-module__9uFBya__testimonialsSection\" data-aos=\"zoom-in\"><div class=\"Testimonials-module-scss-module__9uFBya__container\"><div class=\"Testimonials-module-scss-module__9uFBya__header\"><span class=\"Testimonials-module-scss-module__9uFBya__badge\">Student Feedback</span><h2 class=\"Testimonials-module-scss-module__9uFBya__title\">Success Stories from Learners</h2></div><div class=\"Testimonials-module-scss-module__9uFBya__carouselWrapper\"><div class=\"slick-slider slick-initialized\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"slick-list\"><div class=\"slick-track\" style=\"width:300%;left:-99.99999999999999%\"><div data-index=\"-3\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"slick-slide slick-cloned\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"width:11.11111111111111%\"><div><div class=\"Testimonials-module-scss-module__9uFBya__testimonialCard\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"width:100%;display:inline-block\"><div><div class=\"Testimonials-module-scss-module__9uFBya__avatar\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/1181599/pexels-photo-1181599.jpeg\" alt=\"Network Engineer, Trivandrum\"/></div></div><div class=\"Testimonials-module-scss-module__9uFBya__cardBody\"><div class=\"Testimonials-module-scss-module__9uFBya__rating\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#FFC107\"><path d=\"M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z\"></path></svg><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#FFC107\"><path d=\"M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z\"></path></svg><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#FFC107\"><path d=\"M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z\"></path></svg><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#FFC107\"><path d=\"M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z\"></path></svg><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#FFC107\"><path d=\"M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"Testimonials-module-scss-module__9uFBya__feedback\">“The labs felt like real work—I stopped memorizing and started understanding.”</p><div class=\"Testimonials-module-scss-module__9uFBya__studentInfo\"><p class=\"Testimonials-module-scss-module__9uFBya__name\">Network Engineer, Trivandrum</p><p class=\"Testimonials-module-scss-module__9uFBya__co